{
  "key": 18231,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Vermilion Port is Kanto’s\n",
        "seaside gateway.\r",
        "Luxury liners from around the world\n",
        "dock here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "My Pokémon is preparing the land\n",
        "for construction.\r",
        "But I have no money to start\n",
        "the project."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00002",
      "en_US": "MACHOP: Guooh gogogoh!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "There are eight Gyms in Kanto.\r",
        "That big building is Vermilion’s\n",
        "Pokémon Gym."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Skilled Trainers gather in Kanto.\n",
        "Gym Leaders are especially strong.\r",
        "They won’t be easy to defeat."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "You’ve started to collect Kanto\n",
        "Gym Badges?\r",
        "Don’t you agree that the Trainers\n",
        "here are tough?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "I guess you’ll be finished with your\n",
        "conquest of Kanto Gyms soon.\r",
        "Let me know if you get all\n",
        "eight Badges."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Congratulations!\n",
        "You got all the Kanto Gym Badges.\r",
        "I’ve got a reward for your efforts.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "PP Max is a powerful item that\n",
        "raises a move’s top PP to its maximum.\f",
        "It can change the way you battle!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "PP Max is a powerful item that\n",
        "raises a move’s top PP to its maximum.\f",
        "It can change the way you battle!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Vermilion City\n",
        "The Port of Exquisite Sunsets"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Vermilion City Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Lt. Surge\f",
        "The Lightning American"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon Fan Club\n",
        "All Pokémon Fans Welcome!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00013",
      "en_US": "Vermilion Port Entrance"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Eusine: That was so close!\n",
        "I thought I could corner it by\f",
        "ambushing it here...\r",
        "But running on the water...\n",
        "is beyond me.\r",
        "Still, I am starting to see a pattern.\f",
        "SUICUNE prefers water!\f",
        "That means...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Sorry, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "I’ve got to go!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi!\n",
        "My name is Steven.\f",
        "The Champion from the Hoenn region.\r",
        "Have we met...before?\r",
        "That’s not possible.\n",
        "All the Trainers I have battled\f",
        "seem to have the same look, anyway.\r",
        "Especially the ones who gave me\n",
        "tough battles...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "Steven: By the way, have you heard of\n",
        "a Pokémon called LATIAS?\r",
        "I am investigating why LATIAS,\n",
        "a Pokémon from Hoenn, decided to\f",
        "leave Hoenn to come here.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Steven: By the way, have you heard of\n",
        "a Pokémon called LATIOS?\r",
        "I am investigating why LATIOS,\n",
        "a Pokémon from Hoenn, decided to\f",
        "leave Hoenn to come here.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "LATIAS is a Pokémon that has a lot\n",
        "to do with Soul Dew, a gemlike Orb.\r",
        "Considering the fact that LATIAS is now\n",
        "in Kanto, it is possible to assume that\f",
        "this has to do with the Soul Dew.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "LATIOS is a Pokémon that has a lot\n",
        "to do with Soul Dew, a gemlike Orb.\r",
        "Considering the fact that LATIOS is now\n",
        "in Kanto, it is possible to assume that\f",
        "this has to do with Soul Dew.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "LATIAS is a Pokémon that travels\n",
        "a great distance.\r",
        "It’ll be difficult to find without any\n",
        "machine to track it with.\r",
        "But any Trainer will be drawn to it,\n",
        "won’t they?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00022",
      "en_US": [
        "LATIOS is a Pokémon that travels\n",
        "a great distance.\r",
        "It’ll be difficult to find without any\n",
        "machine to track it with.\r",
        "But any Trainer will be drawn to it,\n",
        "won’t they?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "Steven: I must go.\n",
        "May our journeys cross again.\r"
      ]
    }
  ]
